"Component: Curse of Agony": {
  "index": "2",
  "category": "sorcery",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Curse of Agony"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This malevolent enchantment weaves itself into the very fabric of a living target's being (for it is often said that the dead feel no pain), unleashing a relentless wave of suffering. As the curse takes hold, the afflicted experiences an unyielding torment that manifests as "
        },
        {
          "text": "continual sharp, searing pains coursing through their body. ",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\nHealing offers a flicker of hope, but until such a time that only a "
        },
        {
          "text": "strong enough burst of healing is received",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " the curse remains a dark spectre looming over their existence, pushing them ever closer to the brink of despair and potentially leading to their ultimate collapse under the weight of their misery.\n\nSuch torments fall within the realms of the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Demons of the Nether.",
          "color": "dark_red"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "spell_part",
      "location": "mna:components/curse_of_agony"
    }
  ]
}